OL,3,GNEWSAMen attack boys with keys between
OL,4,Atheir fingers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who attacked a group of
OL,7,Fteenagers and stole a bicycle have been
OL,8,Fconvicted.
OL,10,FDeclan Hyland, 29, Imran Ali, 41, and
OL,11,Fanother man ambushed the three boys on
OL,12,Fa bridge between Ivatt Way and Bourges
OL,13,FBoulevard in Peterborough at about
OL,14,F17:00 BST on 18 April.
OL,16,FThey repeatedly punched them, using
OL,17,Fkeys held between their fingers as
OL,18,Fimprovised weapons, and made off on one
OL,19,Fof their bikes, a Carrera worth #600.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
