OL,3,GNEWSAMen attack boys with keys between
OL,4,Atheir fingers
OL,5,
OL,6,FHyland, of no known address, admitted
OL,7,Frobbery and two counts of attempted
OL,8,Frobbery and was jailed for five years
OL,9,Fat Cambridge Crown Court on 12 October.
OL,10,FAli, also of no known address, denied
OL,11,Fthe same counts but was found guilty
OL,12,Ffollowing a trial at the same court and
OL,13,Fwill be sentenced on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
